{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>JUMP KING QUEST is your new favourite platforming-climbing-adventure from HELL!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317640/extras/JKQsupercutKGy.gif?t=1741382775\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PACKED with irresponsibly ambitious features! Combat, Upgrading, Fast-Travel*, Bosses?! In a CLIMBING GAME!? Only in Jump King Quest!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Guess what!?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317640/extras/There_is_a_Smoking_Hot_Babe_at_the_Top!.png?t=1741382775\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Welcome to The Heights - a sprawling melting pot of Mudmen and other despicable undesirables. All you know is that Up Is Right, and Right is also Might!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317640/extras/JKQenvironmentKGy.gif?t=1741382775\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But remember\u2026 In this world, it\u2019s NEVER GAME OVER! Instead, you get to pick yourself back up EVERY TIME!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317640/extras/High_Stakes_Multiplayer_Action!.png?t=1741382775\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Do you even FEEL that you are in the ONLINE ADVENTURE of your LIFETIME?!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317640/extras/JKQmultiKGy.gif?t=1741382775\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Team up with friends OR explore alone! Nexile\u2019s novel online-system lets you encounter others dynamically on your journey to The Top! But in a world where the only law is gravity, who can you trust?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>(Jump King Quest is also playable in offline mode!)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317640/extras/Jump\u2013Combat!.png?t=1741382775\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Master the JUMP, unique WEAPONS and PARRYING in a harmony of hilarious violence!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317640/extras/JKQweaponscombat2.gif?t=1741382775\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With its roots in fighting-games, this deceptively simple yet high-skill-ceiling\u2019d combat-system is the perfect blend of \u201cSouls-Like\u201d and bing bing WAHOO!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cower in fear, then learn to DOMINATE with your choice among an arsenal of 60+ tools of war and gain MASTERY.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317640/extras/Clenched_Gaming!.png?t=1741382775\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Classic old-school HARDCORE gaming with GROUNDBREAKING bold NEW design choices!</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317640/extras/JKQclenchedKGy.gif?t=1741382775\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Did you ever want to get kicked while you\u2019re down? These bastards won\u2019t EVER hold back!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combat mighty FOES, annoying FRIENDS, innocent STRANGERS and perhaps THOUSANDS that want to stop YOU from reaching the TOP!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317640/extras/Find_Your_Self!.png?t=1741382775\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Live out your deep dark RPG fantasies in a system that both giveth and taketh\u2026</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317640/extras/JKQccsupercutKGy.gif?t=1741382775\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seven dualities will make up your own unique persona, and grow all throughout your journey in accordance with your philosophy...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Feeling WEAK?! Explore the meticulously designed interconnected world of The Heights to unlock new paths, complete quests, and find the UPGRADES you need!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317640/extras/JKQmappanKGy.gif?t=1741382775\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317640/extras/Thickened_Plot!.png?t=1741382775\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The End Times are upon The Heights, but from the darkness you rise to the call of The Smoking Hot Babe at The Top\u2026 From among the Mudmen known as \u201cRedfins\u201d, THE CHOSEN ONE will rise\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Will you stop EVIL LORD KRULK from stealing the Babe Powers and ruining Equilibrium? There can be only ONE TRUE JUMP KING!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317640/extras/JKQbabequest.gif?t=1741382775\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>(Smoking Hot Babe to be added in Act Three!)</i></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Hot Dog Enjoyment!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2317640/724ba45e1ac974d3fbe2e2f3287918042cc51884.jpg"},{"name":"Prison Break","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2317640/724ba45e1ac974d3fbe2e2f3287918042cc51884.jpg"},{"name":"Terra Firma","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2317640/724ba45e1ac974d3fbe2e2f3287918042cc51884.jpg"},{"name":"Fresh Air?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2317640/724ba45e1ac974d3fbe2e2f3287918042cc51884.jpg"},{"name":"Reek of Chaos","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2317640/724ba45e1ac974d3fbe2e2f3287918042cc51884.jpg"},{"name":"Guest Uninvited","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2317640/724ba45e1ac974d3fbe2e2f3287918042cc51884.jpg"},{"name":"Ghostly Chills","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2317640/724ba45e1ac974d3fbe2e2f3287918042cc51884.jpg"},{"name":"Demonic Fate","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2317640/724ba45e1ac974d3fbe2e2f3287918042cc51884.jpg"},{"name":"Gnoscome's Disgrace","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2317640/724ba45e1ac974d3fbe2e2f3287918042cc51884.jpg"},{"name":"Joust!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2317640/724ba45e1ac974d3fbe2e2f3287918042cc51884.jpg"}],"total":32},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2317640?t=1741382775","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317640/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741382775","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317640/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741382775","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317640/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741382775","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>JUMP KING QUEST is your new favourite platforming-climbing-adventure from HELL!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317640/extras/JKQsupercutKGy.gif?t=1741382775\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PACKED with irresponsibly ambitious features! Combat, Upgrading, Fast-Travel*, Bosses?! In a CLIMBING GAME!? Only in Jump King Quest!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Guess what!?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317640/extras/There_is_a_Smoking_Hot_Babe_at_the_Top!.png?t=1741382775\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Welcome to The Heights - a sprawling melting pot of Mudmen and other despicable undesirables. All you know is that Up Is Right, and Right is also Might!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317640/extras/JKQenvironmentKGy.gif?t=1741382775\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But remember\u2026 In this world, it\u2019s NEVER GAME OVER! Instead, you get to pick yourself back up EVERY TIME!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317640/extras/High_Stakes_Multiplayer_Action!.png?t=1741382775\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Do you even FEEL that you are in the ONLINE ADVENTURE of your LIFETIME?!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317640/extras/JKQmultiKGy.gif?t=1741382775\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Team up with friends OR explore alone! Nexile\u2019s novel online-system lets you encounter others dynamically on your journey to The Top! But in a world where the only law is gravity, who can you trust?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>(Jump King Quest is also playable in offline mode!)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317640/extras/Jump\u2013Combat!.png?t=1741382775\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Master the JUMP, unique WEAPONS and PARRYING in a harmony of hilarious violence!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317640/extras/JKQweaponscombat2.gif?t=1741382775\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With its roots in fighting-games, this deceptively simple yet high-skill-ceiling\u2019d combat-system is the perfect blend of \u201cSouls-Like\u201d and bing bing WAHOO!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cower in fear, then learn to DOMINATE with your choice among an arsenal of 60+ tools of war and gain MASTERY.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317640/extras/Clenched_Gaming!.png?t=1741382775\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Classic old-school HARDCORE gaming with GROUNDBREAKING bold NEW design choices!</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317640/extras/JKQclenchedKGy.gif?t=1741382775\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Did you ever want to get kicked while you\u2019re down? These bastards won\u2019t EVER hold back!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combat mighty FOES, annoying FRIENDS, innocent STRANGERS and perhaps THOUSANDS that want to stop YOU from reaching the TOP!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317640/extras/Find_Your_Self!.png?t=1741382775\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Live out your deep dark RPG fantasies in a system that both giveth and taketh\u2026</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317640/extras/JKQccsupercutKGy.gif?t=1741382775\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seven dualities will make up your own unique persona, and grow all throughout your journey in accordance with your philosophy...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Feeling WEAK?! Explore the meticulously designed interconnected world of The Heights to unlock new paths, complete quests, and find the UPGRADES you need!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317640/extras/JKQmappanKGy.gif?t=1741382775\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317640/extras/Thickened_Plot!.png?t=1741382775\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The End Times are upon The Heights, but from the darkness you rise to the call of The Smoking Hot Babe at The Top\u2026 From among the Mudmen known as \u201cRedfins\u201d, THE CHOSEN ONE will rise\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Will you stop EVIL LORD KRULK from stealing the Babe Powers and ruining Equilibrium? There can be only ONE TRUE JUMP KING!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317640/extras/JKQbabequest.gif?t=1741382775\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>(Smoking Hot Babe to be added in Act Three!)</i></p>","developers":["Nexile"],"ge